Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Problem:
A negative value-length in PduParser.parseContentType bypasses the bounds check, leading to an integer underflow and a massive array allocation (new byte[2GiB]) which causes an OutOfMemoryError in com.android.phone.

Fix details:
Added a bounds check `if (length < 0 || length > startPos)` in `PduParser.parseContentType` to reject negative lengths.

Bug: 517378147
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Test: atest TelephonyCommonTests:com.google.android.mms.pdu.test.PduParserTest
TAG=agy
CONV=0ecc5045-71ce-4e1d-a344-332cbbd9a407
Change-Id: I531242bfd3036da856c3e5b9737d48f17bb3b15e

(cherry picked from commit b4d69c821e1e8b8025c0d41e0029de92cd96cc23)
